<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier league soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Arsenal 2 (Hartson 73rd, Parlour 88th) Sunderland 0. Halftime 0-0. Attendance: 38,016</p>
<p>Chelsea 1 (Vialli 51st) Nottingham Forest 1 (Lee 90th). 0-0. 27,673</p>
<p>Coventry 0 Blackburn 0. 17,032</p>
<p>Derby 0 Wimbledon 2 (Earle 49th, Gayle 70th) 0-0. 17,022</p>
<p>Everton 2 (Kanchelskis 17th, Stuart 60th) Sheffield Wednesday 0. 1-0. 34,160</p>
<p>Leiceser 1 (Heskey 60th) Leeds 0. 0-0. 20,359.</p>
<p>Southampton 4 (Oakey 11th, Le Tissier 29th, 48th, Watson 82nd) Middlesbrough 0. 2-0. 15,230.</p>
